{
  "label": "yumispecial45",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label yumispecial45:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka1.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Today’s story starts in the back of a familiar classroom- close to where the main character would sit if this were a run of the mill anime or manga series.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Fortunately for some and unfortunately for others, our protagonist is off doing something else right now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But don’t worry! I’ll be here to keep you entertained until he makes it back.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I mean, what’s the sense in constantly following Sensei around if all of the interesting stuff is going to be happening here, right?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is no different from all of the other times we’ve spent together.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I was just feeling a little friendly today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who am I, you ask?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ha!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Wouldn’t you like to know?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, before we begin, I’d like to remind you that these are [teenage]girls we’re dealing with.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And sometimes, [teenage]girls tend to be impulsive or irrational or whatever else you want to call it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Do you see where I’m going with this?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sometimes, mountains are made out of molehills. And other times, things that are supposed to be perceived one way wind up being twisted into something entirely different.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I’m sure you’re familiar with the concept of perception by now, aren’t you?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re so smart.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Unless you’re one of those people who didn’t work for where you are right now, I mean.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Frankly, I wish those people would explode.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s something I’m allowed to say because you still have no idea who I am, or even the voice you’re supposed to be reading these words in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I won’t waste any more of your time dwelling on that- not when there are so many cute girls right in front of you!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, which of these girls do you think will be the main character of this event?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I guess there’s only one way to find out!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you guys think I’d look good with short hair?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka2.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you actually thinking of cutting it?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mmm...I don’t know. Maybe?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like half of the girls in this manga have short hair and they all look really cool and hot and stuff. I want to be cool and hot and stuff.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I already think you’re hot and stuff. But hey, follow your dreams and all that.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did you leave out the part about me being cool?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka3.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So anyway, Futaba, you have any plans for Christmas? Rin and I were thinking about going to the urban district if you wanted to tag along.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if you’re worried about being the third wheel or something, just invite Nodoka along. I’m sure she’d be happy to be your date.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Few things in life would make me happier.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll...be sure to check my schedule...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka4.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Yumi. I didn’t think you were going to show up today.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neither did I, but here I am...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The fuck are you doing, though? Why’s it look like you’re about to leave?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka5.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...you know...I was just gonna go...walk around and stuff...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re looking for our douchebag teacher, I think I saw him near the library.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka6.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See, this is why I keep you around. You always know exactly what it is I’m looking for.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do realize how fucking easy you are to read, right? No need to be impressed.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wanna come with me? Or are you going to hang out here?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka7.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...don’t tell me today’s the day...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it finally happening?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is my best friend taking her first step toward adulthood?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, first off, can you word it in a way that makes it sound, you know, less fucking disgusting?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And second, I’ve taken plenty of steps toward adulthood. I watch your sister just as much as you do. Fuck, probably even more, actually.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka8.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. You’ve been a huge help.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’m really proud of you for this, Yumi. I mean it.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like it was just the other day that-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka9.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if yumiknows == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, yeah. Whatever. Just go back to stalking your totally legitimate boyfriend and stop being all mushy and shit. It’s gonna make me sick.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, yeah. Whatever. Just go back to stalking our creepy fucking teacher and stop being all mushy and shit. It’s gonna make me sick.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, it’s really impressive how you can still manage to be such a bitch even when you’re taking steps to improve yourself.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t get too impressed. Wouldn’t want you falling for me instead of a dude twice your age.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ew, I’m not going to fall for my roommate.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka10.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d let you join in if Sensei wanted, though.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yo! Don’t even fuckin’ joke about shit like-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka11.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bye, Yumi! I’ll let you know if you’re needed~",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...that.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "As Chika wanders off to locate the object of her ever-apparent affection, the real main character of today’s event wanders into the classroom.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And, if you haven’t guessed by the obvious mentions of self-betterment and taking steps toward adulthood, that main character plans on doing something she should have done a long time ago.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Of course, a plan is just a plan- and until that plan is actually in motion, it’s no better than any of the many goals people set for themselves only to either fail or give up entirely.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So, who knows? Maybe she’ll do it, maybe she-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka12.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, look!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There she goes!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Come on! Let’s see what happens!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka13.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yo.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think she’s talking to you, Futaba.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Uhh...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka14.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...talking to me, Yumi?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There a problem with that?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": N-Not at all! It’s just...not how this normally goes...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you need something?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka15.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? You her gatekeeper now?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, but if you’re just here to be mean to her, I see no reason for her to have to respond to you.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka16.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Listen...can you like...come out into the hall for a second? There’s some shit I’ve gotta say to-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anything you have to say to her can be said in front of all of us.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka17.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, great. Are you her gatekeeper?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka18.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think that’s what I’d necessarily call myself, but for the sake of the conversation, we can just assume that I am.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nodoka, I can-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shh, no. Let Nodoka handle this. I feel like she can be really scary when she wants to be.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Excuse me, fair lady, but could I trouble you for the permission to spend a few minutes alone with your princess?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe if you try asking again without the unappreciated and irrefutably immature dose of sarcasm you decided to add in.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry, what’s your name again?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nodoka Nagasawa.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka19.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi, Nodoka. Nice to meet you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, please step aside if you have any interest in keeping all of your teeth.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka20.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, would you look at that? Only forty-five seconds in and you’re already resorting to violence.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I knew from all I’ve heard that you were the type to jump to that right away, but I imagined we’d be able to talk for at least two minutes before any threats showed up.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Listen, I don’t know who the fuck you think you are, but if I had business with you, I would have talked to you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t do shit, Nodoka. So step the fuck aside and let me do what I came here to do without getting in the way.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yuminodoka21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yuminodoka21.webp",
      "alt": "yuminodoka21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what might that be? Because probability shows that it’s likely something along the lines of hurting my friend’s feelings in complete disregard for-",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nodoka...I’m glad that you’re standing up for me, but you really don’t have to do this...",
